### Summary

The exponential generating function is

$$
\boxed{\,H(x)=\sum_{n\ge 0}h(n)\frac{x^n}{n!}=\exp\!\bigl(e^{2x}-e^{x}\bigr)\,}
$$

with the values $h(1),\dots,h(15)$ as listed in the table above.

